/font></font></font></font></span></span></p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li style=\"box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important; color:#10132e; font-weight:normal; text-decoration:inherit; text-transform:none\">\n\t\t<p align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"padding-bottom:0.5em\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, serif\"><font style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent !important; font: 14px/1.5 OpenSans, sans-serif !important;\"><font size=\"2\"><font style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent !important; font: 14px/1.5 OpenSans, sans-serif !important;\">which are lost or abandoned or damaged during driving or extraction, or</font></font></font></font></span></span></p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li style=\"box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important; color:#10132e; font-weight:normal; text-decoration:inherit; text-transform:none\">\n\t\t<p align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"padding-bottom:0.5em\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, serif\"><font style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent !important; font: 14px/1.5 OpenSans, sans-serif !important;\"><font size=\"2\"><font style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent !important; font: 14px/1.5 OpenSans, sans-serif !important;\">which have become obstructed by jammed or damaged piling equipment or</font></font></font></font><font color=\"#0000ff\"><font style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent !important; font: 14px/1.5 OpenSans, sans-serif !important;\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, serif\"><font style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent !important; font: 14px/1.5 OpenSans, sans-serif !important;\"><font size=\"2\"><font st