0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"orphans:2\"><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"font-family:OpenSans, sans-serif\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"orphans:2\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><font style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent !important; font: 14px/1.5 OpenSans, sans-serif !important;\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important; font:14px/1.5 OpenSans, sans-serif !important\"><font size=\"2\"><font style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent !important; font: 14px/1.5 OpenSans, sans-serif !important;\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important; font:14px/1.5 OpenSans, sans-serif !important\">Loss, damage or liability resulting from the Insured&rsquo;s not immediately removing obstructions (e.g. sand, trees) from watercourses within the construction site, whether carrying or not, in order to maintain free waterflow shall not be indemnifiable</font></font></font></font></font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></s