bkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><font size=\"2\"><font style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent !important; font: 14px/1.5 OpenSans, sans-serif !important;\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important; font:14px/1.5 OpenSans, sans-serif !important\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important; font:14px/1.5 OpenSans, sans-serif !important\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important; font:14px/1.5 OpenSans, sans-serif !important\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important; font:14px/1.5 OpenSans, sans-serif !important\">Occurring during the maintenance period provided such loss or damage was caused on the site during the construction period before the certificate of completion for the lost or damaged section was issued.</font></font></font></font></font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></spa