,{
"ClauseCode":"1010661"
,"ClauseContent":"<ol>\n\t<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\">Being Co-Insurance of the under mentioned insurance companies, they shall, each of themselves and not for the other, severally and independently have rights and assume the liabilities in proportion to their respective share as mentioned below</span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\">PT ASURANSI SINAR MAS as the representative of the Co-Insurance shall attend to all matters connected with the Co-Insurance including processing of claims but premium collection and claims payment are handled by each Co-Insurer independently.</span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\">Any agreement or decision which may be made between the assured and PT ASURANSI SINAR MAS in connection with this Co-Insurance shall be final and binding upon all other Co-Insurers</span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\">Any notice which may be given by the assured to PT ASURANSI SINAR MAS in writing or otherwise shall be deemed as given to all other Co-Insurers as well.</span></span></li>\n</ol>"
,"ClauseDescription":"Co-Insurance Clause"
,"FlagOldData":"1"
