ces arising out of any one event.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"border: none; padding: 0in; margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"border:none windowtext 1.0pt; font-size:10.0pt; padding:0in\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:black\">the cost of labour expended in such re-writing or re-drawing including all necessary overtime or research</span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n</div>"
,"ClauseDescription":"Plan and Document Clause (Limit IDR. 2,000,000,000,-)"
,"FlagOldData":"1"
