style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><font style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent !important; font: 14px/1.5 OpenSans, sans-serif !important;\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent !important; font:14px/1.5 OpenSans, sans-serif !important\">C. any obligation to defend any sue or claim againts the insured alleging personal injury, or property damage and seeking damages, if such suit or claim arises from personal injury or property damage resulting from or contributed to, by any and all manufacture of, mining of,use of, sales of, installation of, removal of, distribution of, or exposure to asbestos, asbestos products, asbestos fibers or asbestos dust.</font></font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>"
