e Insured or any other party.<br />\n10 Data means information, facts, concepts, code or any other information of any kind that is recorded or transmitted in a form to be used, accessed, processed, transmitted or stored by a Computer System.<br />\n11 Data Processing Media means any property insured by this Policy on which Data can be stored but not the Data itself.<br />\n&nbsp;</p>"
